---
title: "4 · Tools exist only while the pane is open"
---
%%{init: {"theme":"dark","themeVariables":{"fontSize":"16px","fontFamily":"Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor You
    participant Panel as Director pane
    participant Orch as comfyui-mcp
    participant LLM as The agent

    Note over Orch,LLM: idle — the agent sees only the entry point

    You->>Panel: open the Director tab
    Panel->>Orch: pane_state { open: true }
    Orch->>Orch: mount the director tool group
    Orch--)LLM: notifications/tools/list_changed
    LLM->>Orch: tools/list
    Orch-->>LLM: + graph · link · subgraph · project · story · render

    Note over You,LLM: you edit by hand, the agent edits by tool — same graph, same time

    LLM->>Panel: promote Beat to subgraph
    Panel-->>LLM: ok
    You->>Panel: drag a scene in
    Panel->>Panel: rails reconcile, labels survive

    You->>Panel: close the tab
    Panel->>Orch: pane_state { open: false }
    Orch->>Orch: unmount the group
    Orch--)LLM: notifications/tools/list_changed

    Note over Orch,LLM: back to idle — no dead tools, no stale surface
